# Optional. Leave empty when hosting on Netlify: the contact form then uses Netlify Forms.
# For other hosts (Vercel, GitHub Pages), create a free form at https://formspree.io
# and paste its endpoint here, e.g. https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz
# A Formspree endpoint is public by design, so it is safe in frontend code.
# Never put secret API keys in VITE_ variables: everything prefixed VITE_ ships to the browser.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=
